{
  "_note": "The match flow's look and popup table (crates/core/src/flow/look.rs). Colours are 0-255 and opacities percent; times ms; sizes in the HUD's 1920 x 1080 units, the burst's in mm. fonts: display (big words) and body (labels), CSS families with the glyph advance in percent of the size. popups.rows: each names a MatchEvent by its JSON type, an optional 'when' (dotted field paths that must equal a value, or '*' for any), the string key of its text, a style, how to fill each {placeholder} (name:<field> a seat's player name, fish:<field> a roster id's fish name, tier:<field> a tier's name, text:<field> the value), the field holding a tier for a tier style, who sees it (all, mine, others; by the event's seat) and a group (popups in one group replace each other in place). The first row that matches an event is used. postgame: the reveal's pacing. burst: a wreck's explosion and the wrecked player's camera shake. ghost_pct: how solid a ghosted boat is drawn.",
  "fonts": {
    "display": { "family": "'Arial Rounded MT Bold', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', 'Verdana', sans-serif", "weight": "bold", "advance": 76 },
    "body": { "family": "'Trebuchet MS', 'Verdana', 'DejaVu Sans', sans-serif", "weight": "bold", "advance": 62 }
  },
